## Merkle Root Commitment

### Algorithm Specification
```
Algorithm: SHA256-based binary Merkle tree
Leaf encoding: SHA256_HASH + "\n" + PUBLIC_ID (UTF-8 bytes)
Internal node encoding: SHA256(LEFT_CHILD || RIGHT_CHILD)
Salt: None (deterministic construction)
Padding: Duplicate last leaf if odd count at any level
```

### Leaf Hashes (to be populated)
```
# Format: LEAF_INDEX | PUBLIC_ID | SHA256_HASH | SOURCE_INDEX_FILE
# Example:
LEAF_000 | syntropic-core-v0.1 | a1b2c3d4... | /council/ARCHIVE_INDEX.md
LEAF_001 | syntropic-core-v0.2 | e5f6g7h8... | /council/ARCHIVE_INDEX.md
LEAF_002 | council-archive-tool | i9j0k1l2... | /council/ARCHIVE_INDEX.md
LEAF_003 | telemetry-module | m3n4o5p6... | /lineage/ARCHIVE_INDEX.md
LEAF_004 | merged-pipeline-v1 | q7r8s9t0... | /public-accountability/ARCHIVE_INDEX.md
# ... additional leaves as artifacts are indexed
```

### Computed Merkle Root
```
MERKLE_ROOT: [COMPUTED_AFTER_POPULATING_LEAVES]
ROOT_COMPUTATION_TIMESTAMP: [ISO8601_TIMESTAMP]
TOTAL_LEAF_COUNT: [INTEGER]
TREE_DEPTH: [INTEGER, ceil(log2(LEAF_COUNT))]
```

